<title>USA: TABLE - Acme United Corp Q2 net, shr profit.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Acme United Corp Q2 net, shr profit.</headline>
<dateline>FAIRFIELD, Conn. 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>SECOND QUARTER REPORT 1997</p>
<p>				     Qtr Ended	     Qtr Ended</p>
<p>				  Jun 30, 1997	  Jun 30, 1996</p>
<p> Amounts in thousands,     (Unaudited)	   (Unaudited)</p>
<p>except per share data</p>
<p> Net Sales			   $12,854		 $12,782</p>
<p> Net Income/(Loss)		     222		 (1,239)</p>
<p> Earnings/(Loss) Per Share	   .07		   (.37)</p>
<p>				 Six Mos Ended	 Six Mos Ended</p>
<p>				  Jun 30, 1997	  Jun 30, 1996</p>
<p> Net Sales			    23,734		  24,822</p>
<p> Net Income/(Loss)		     503		 (2,055)</p>
<p> Earnings/(Loss) Per Share	   .15		   (.62)</p>
<p>NOTES: Net sales 1996 included $237,000 for former Altenbach subsidiary. Excluding Altenbach, sales increased $309,000, or 2.5% in Q2 1997 vs Q2 1996.</p>
<p>Net income in first half 1997 from on-going operations was $346,000, or $0.10/share. The net gain reported in Q1 1997 on sale of U.S. Marketing rights of certain wound care products to Seton Healthcare International Ltd offset by one-time charges was $157,000.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
